# duty_board.dlg
# A one-beat interaction: some narration, and a line that changes once the
# player knows more. Read docs/writing/dialogue-format.md before editing.

:: start
> The duty board is a sheet of paper and forty years of thumbtack holes.
if read_case_file -> after_file
Choi: Third shift. Same as the last eleven.
Choi @tired: Ward's name is on it too. That's new.
set saw_board = true
end

:: after_file
Choi: Ward's name is on the board, on the file, and in the sign-out log.
Choi @wary: Three places is a pattern.
set saw_board = true
end
